      <title>智界RX成都车展首秀，鸿蒙智行高端SUV布局再落一子</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260821/%E6%99%BA%E7%95%8CRX%E6%88%90%E9%83%BD%E8%BD%A6%E5%B1%95%E9%A6%96%E7%A7%80%E9%B8%BF%E8%92%99%E6%99%BA%E8%A1%8C%E9%AB%98%E7%AB%AFSUV%E5%B8%83%E5%B1%80%E5%86%8D%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%80%E5%AD%90/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260821/%E6%99%BA%E7%95%8CRX%E6%88%90%E9%83%BD%E8%BD%A6%E5%B1%95%E9%A6%96%E7%A7%80%E9%B8%BF%E8%92%99%E6%99%BA%E8%A1%8C%E9%AB%98%E7%AB%AFSUV%E5%B8%83%E5%B1%80%E5%86%8D%E8%90%BD%E4%B8%80%E5%AD%90/</guid>
      <description>智界RX实车首秀，设计语言全面革新 8月21日，2026成都车展现场，鸿蒙智行旗下智界RX轿跑SUV迎来实车首秀。这款新车的前脸设计一改此前智界R7/S7的凌厉造型，转而采用更为圆润的线条，并配备了全新的星眸大灯，支持迎宾、充电、语音专属灯效，提升了人车交互的仪式感。车标也换成了镂</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>比亚迪第三代唐SUV全球首秀，四季度上市能否再掀波澜</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260821/%E6%AF%94%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%AA%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BB%A3%E5%94%90SUV%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E9%A6%96%E7%A7%80%E5%9B%9B%E5%AD%A3%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82%E8%83%BD%E5%90%A6%E5%86%8D%E6%8E%80%E6%B3%A2%E6%BE%9C/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
